    <item>
      <title>地平线2024年中国辅助驾驶芯片份额第一，明年目标高阶市场超英伟达</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260905/%E5%9C%B0%E5%B9%B3%E7%BA%BF2024%E5%B9%B4%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E8%BE%85%E5%8A%A9%E9%A9%BE%E9%A9%B6%E8%8A%AF%E7%89%87%E4%BB%BD%E9%A2%9D%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E6%98%8E%E5%B9%B4%E7%9B%AE%E6%A0%87%E9%AB%98%E9%98%B6%E5%B8%82%E5%9C%BA%E8%B6%85%E8%8B%B1%E4%BC%9F%E8%BE%BE/</link>
